          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The conflict is with %@, which may be a required app. Adopt or repair that app separately in CaskHub, then retry %@." : {
      "comment" : "Conflict with another app, possibly a dependency. %1$@ is the conflicting app filename; %2$@ is the requested app name. Adopt means bring an existing app under Homebrew management.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The conflict is with %1$@, which may be a required app. Adopt or repair that app separately in CaskHub, then retry %2$@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El conflicto es con %1$@, que podría ser una app necesaria. Adopta o repara esa app por separado en CaskHub y luego vuelve a intentar %2$@."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Конфликт возник с %1$@ — это приложение может быть необходимо для установки. Отдельно передайте его под управление Homebrew или восстановите через CaskHub, затем повторите попытку для %2$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "衝突涉及 %1$@，這可能是必要的 App。請先在 CaskHub 中個別接管或修復該 App，再重試 %2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The disk image is already in use. Eject any mounted copy of it, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La imagen de disco ya está en uso. Expulsa cualquier copia montada e inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Образ диска уже используется. Извлеките все подключённые копии образа и попробуйте снова."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
